OL,3,GNEWSAFlamingo chicks hatch at Curraghs
OL,4,AWildlife Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour Chilean flamingo chicks have
OL,7,Fhatched at Curraghs Wildlife Park in
OL,8,FBallaugh, with more still to hatch, in
OL,9,Fwhat the park says could be "another
OL,10,Ffantastic" breeding season.
OL,12,FThe chicks are born grey and can take
OL,13,Fup to two years to develop the pink
OL,14,Fcolouring flamingos are known for.
OL,16,FFlamingos get their colour from
OL,17,Fpigments in the shrimp and algae they
OL,18,Feat, so newly-hatched chicks stay grey
OL,19,Ffor weeks before slowly turning pink.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
