OL,3,GNEWSAFlamingo chicks hatch at Curraghs
OL,4,AWildlife Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chilean flamingo is classed as Near
OL,7,FThreatened on the IUCN Red List, with
OL,8,Fthe wild population in gradual decline.
